WEBVTT

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:30.870
I want to

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:07.520
I don't know

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:59.910
This program was brought to you by Sega Enterprises and Kadokawa Shoten.

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:30.000
At 12:30, at the center of the Tokai region,

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:34.140
A special emergency declaration has been issued.

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:38.530
Please evacuate to the designated shelter as soon as possible.

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:42.890
I repeat, at 12:30 p.m. today,

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:49.670
a special emergency declaration has been issued in the entire central part of the Kanto region.

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:51.670
Please evacuate to the designated shelter as soon as possible.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:59.380
I can't believe they're losing sight of me at a time like this.

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:03.620
All routes are normal at the moment.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:05.760
No good.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:10.310
I knew they wouldn't come.

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:15.360
I can't wait.

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:18.030
I can't help it.

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:19.100
Let's go to the shelter.

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:55.830
It's been 15 years, hasn't it?

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:57.750
Yeah, no doubt about it.

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:00.000
It's a human.

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:35.250
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.330
It's an all-out battle.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:03.330
Get all of Atsugi and Iruma up.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.790
There's no way to get them out.

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.590
No matter what, we must destroy their target.

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:21.860
It's supposed to be that way.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:24.580
The tank squadron has been destroyed.

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:28.140
Both the guided weapon and the cannon explosion don't seem to have any effect.

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:29.000
It's no good.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.000
With this level of firepower,

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.180
I don't want to be a soldier!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:34.010
You're AT Field, after all.

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:35.000
Yeah.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:41.410
Normal weapons won't be of any use to the capital.

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:42.230
Understood.

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:48.920
I'll activate it as planned.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.840
Wait, no way...

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:53.010
Are you going to use the N2 Jiraiya?

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:53.720
Throw it away!

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.880
Unfortunately, it seems you didn't have a chance to show up.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:22.820
Shougekiha.

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:26.710
Are you okay?

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:27.470
Yes.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:30.000
My mouth is tingling.

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:31.900
That's fine.

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:34.420
Well then, let's go.

00:06:34.420 --> 00:06:36.470
Ready, go!

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:46.070
Thank you very much.

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.160
You saved me.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:49.000
No, it's my fault.

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:50.090
Katsuragi-san.

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:52.590
Misato is fine.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.760
Please take care of her again.

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.310
Ikari Shinji-kun.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:57.390
Yes.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.070
That's...

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.330
It's that explosion.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.550
There's a kick to it.

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:06.310
Sensor will be restored.

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:08.620
When the explosion occurs!

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:10.530
What?!

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:12.370
Sensor will be restored.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:19.070
It's our trump card.

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:21.280
What's going on?

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:23.650
You monster!

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:35.770
Don't worry about it.

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:38.020
He's in the top priority.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:39.890
So, prepare a cart lane.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:41.980
A straight one.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.320
Yes.

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:45.680
I said I'd come pick you up.

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:47.280
I'll take full responsibility.

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:51.080
Bye.

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.260
But it's already the worst.

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:55.560
I just restored it.

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:57.390
And it's already broken.

00:07:57.390 --> 00:08:00.000
The loan is 33 times more than the repair fee.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.000
Oh, I see. Plus, you don't even have a dress for Icchoula.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.960
Um, Misato-san...

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:07.960
I've put a lot of effort into this, but...

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.820
Um, Misato-san...

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:10.990
What?

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:14.590
Are you sure you want to do something like this?

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:20.590
Oh, no, no, no. It's emergency now, so I have to move the car, right?

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:23.590
Besides, I'm an international civil servant, even if I look like this.

00:08:23.590 --> 00:08:26.950
Banji is okay.

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.950
That's an excuse to be persuasive.

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.000
It's boring.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:33.530
You look cute, and you're surprisingly calm, aren't you?

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.430
Is that so?

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:37.050
Huh? Are you angry?

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:41.650
I'm sorry, I'm sorry. You're a boy, aren't you?

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:44.470
Misato-san, you're a childlike person despite your age, aren't you?

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:53.310
As expected, she's recovering from an accident.

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:57.400
If she's not, she'll be useful as a single weapon.

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:02.810
It's a big thing.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:05.050
Can it even double the function?

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:07.400
It seems it has intelligence, too.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:11.680
It's a matter of time for it to progress again.

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:18.150
Captain Nerf?

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:18.850
That's right.

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:21.320
The United Nations direct flight organization.

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:23.620
It's where my father is.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:24.720
Well...

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:26.660
Do you know your father's job?

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:37.790
I heard from the teacher that it's an important job to protect humanity.

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:41.030
From now on, the commander of this operation will be you.

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:42.730
Show me your skills.

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:43.890
Roger that.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:51.290
Ikari, let's admit that we don't have any effective means against the target with our own weapons.

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:54.400
But will you be able to win?

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.600
I'm NERV for that.

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:59.540
I'm looking forward to it.

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:02.340
There is still no change in the system.

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:05.340
Currently, the operation rate of the attack system is 7.5%.

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:08.920
The U.S. military is also firing?

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:11.720
What are you going to do?

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.990
Activate the first machine.

00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:14.990
The first machine?

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:17.190
There is no pilot.

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:18.500
No problem.

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.650
Another person's call will arrive.

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:24.720
Are you going to your father's place from now on?

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.190
That's right.

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:27.170
That's right.

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:37.300
-Dad... -Didn't you get your ID from your father?

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:43.860
-Yes. Here you are. -Thank you.

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:49.910
-Well then, read this. -Nerf?

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:54.650
Dad's job? Is there something I can do?

00:10:54.650 --> 00:11:00.000
That's right. Even though I don't read it, my father...

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.790
You're not going to send me a letter, are you?

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:06.280
I see. You're not good at it, are you, Dad?

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:09.930
Just like me.

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.520
Wow!

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:19.520
It really is a geofront!

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:22.560
Yes. This is our secret base.

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:23.880
The NERV headquarters.

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:25.800
The key to world reconstruction.

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:28.070
The place where humanity will become a fortress.

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:39.930
That's weird. I'm sure it's this way.

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:42.300
Central Dogma's closed passage is...

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:45.710
It's hard to open a skirt from here, isn't it?

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:48.840
But where did Ritsuko go?

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:51.670
I'm sorry. I'm not used to it yet.

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:53.780
I just passed by here.

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:59.640
But it's okay. The system exists to be used.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:03.180
I'm Dr. Akagi Ritsuko, in charge of the E-Plan.

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:04.830
Dr. Akagi Ritsuko.

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:09.800
Please contact me at Katsuragi Misato Ichiba.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:11.300
I'm so shocked.

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:13.730
You got lost again, didn't you?

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:26.330
Tsuragi Ichi.

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:28.590
If there's no one, there's no time.

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:29.750
Sorry!

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:34.720
That's the guy, isn't he?

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:35.830
Yes.

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:39.030
Third Children, according to Marduk's report.

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:40.590
Nice to meet you.

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:42.520
Oh, yes.

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:45.370
He's just like his father.

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:47.760
He's not as cute as he used to be.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.290
Then I'll leave it to you.

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:56.110
It's been three years since we've seen each other.

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:58.040
Vice Commander.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.000
The target is moving again.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.210
I've started the operation.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:02.510
Good.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.480
Set up the first type of battle.

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:10.830
Repeat.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:11.830
This is the most important thing.

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:14.710
So, what about the first machine?

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:17.760
It's still in cooling mode with the P-type equipment.

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:19.590
Is it really moving?

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:21.590
It hasn't moved once yet, right?

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:26.410
The starting probability is 0.0000001%.

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.760
It's often called the O-9 system.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.520
Does that mean it won't work?

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:33.930
Oh, that's rude.

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:35.050
It's not zero.

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:37.240
It's above the number.

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:41.590
Well, it won't work if it doesn't work anyway.

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:03.860
Even if I look for it, I can't find it.

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:07.920
The ultimate humanoid battle weapon created by humans.

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:10.250
The human-made human Evangelion.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.910
The first generation of it.

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:14.350
Construction was carried out by Gokuhiri.

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:17.180
We humans are the last trump card.

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:19.180
Is this also your father's job?

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:22.120
That's right.

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:24.940
It's been a long time.

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:29.020
Father...

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:29.670
Assault.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.310
Launch!

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:33.310
The No. 0 is being frozen, isn't it?

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:37.680
Are you going to use the No. 1?

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.960
There is no other way.

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:43.420
Hey, Rei can't move it yet, right?

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:46.210
There is no pilot.

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:48.480
I just got it.

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:50.260
Really?

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:51.260
Shinji Ikari?

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:52.020
Yes.

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:54.960
You will take it.

00:14:54.960 --> 00:15:00.000
But it took 7 months to synchronize with Ayanami Rei and EVA, right?

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.000
It's impossible for a girl like her who has just arrived!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.920
You can just sit there.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:04.920
I don't want anything else.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:05.750
But...

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:08.770
Right now, death and destruction are the most important things.

00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:15.170
For that, there is no other way but to put in a person who can be synchronized with Eva.

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:17.920
You should know that, Katsuragi Ichi.

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:21.300
That's right.

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:24.300
Father...

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:25.570
Why did you call me?

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:27.550
Just as you thought.

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:29.800
Then, I'll...

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:33.260
I'm going to get on this and fight the last one.

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:34.250
That's right.

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.040
I don't want that.

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:37.900
What are you talking about now?

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:40.490
Didn't you want me to do it?

00:15:40.490 --> 00:15:47.410
I called you because I needed it.

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:50.420
It's impossible for other people.

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:52.590
It's impossible.

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:56.960
I've never seen it or heard of it, but I can't do it.

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:59.000
Take the explanation.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.000
No way.

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:03.320
I can't do it!

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:06.610
I can't ride this!

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:08.770
If you want to ride it, hurry up.

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:10.120
If you don't, go home!

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:36.110
Get on.

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:38.230
I don't want to.

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:42.170
I came all the way here, but there's nothing like this!

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:46.740
Shinji-kun, why did you come here?

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:49.940
Don't run away!

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:52.760
From your father, and above all, from yourself!

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:54.560
I know!

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:57.200
But I can't do it!

00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:08.770
Fuyutsuki, wake up Rei.

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:10.340
I can use it.

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:13.620
It's not like you're dead.

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:19.530
Rei, you can't use the spare parts.

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:22.070
One more time.

00:17:22.070 --> 00:17:27.560
Rewrite the initial system to Rei and reboot!

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:37.490
After all, I don't need humans.

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:31.920
It can't move!

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:34.640
It doesn't even have an interface, but it's reacting!

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:37.140
Rather than that, it protected him!

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:38.840
Protected him!

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:06.560
I can't run away!

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:09.330
I can't run away!

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:11.060
I'll do it!

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:15.370
I'll ride it!

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:19.740
Restart complete.

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:21.730
Docking 1.

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:23.240
Stopping signal plug.

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:24.520
Exhaust complete.

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:56.820
If your blood pressure is met with LCL, it will take oxygen directly into your blood.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:03.170
I'm sorry...

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:05.430
Hang in there! You're a boy, aren't you?

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:06.350
Yeah...

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:08.360
Power supply connected.

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:10.050
Power transmission on all circuits.

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:10.980
Roger that.

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:13.390
We're entering secondary contact.

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:17.190
No abnormalities in the A-point nervous system.

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:22.850
The thought system is fixed as a basic Japanese principle.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:25.580
No problems with the initial contact.

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:27.560
All directions are open.

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:30.000
Synchronization rate: 41.3%.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.430
This is amazing.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.510
All of the Harmonix units are in normal state.

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:35.850
There is no rampage.

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:37.190
We can do this.

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:39.810
Prepare to launch!

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:41.820
Prepare to launch!

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:44.440
The first Cobalt has been launched!

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:49.430
The umbilical bridge is moving!

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:52.720
The second Cobalt has been launched!

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:57.410
The first highway has been removed.

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:59.530
The same goes for the second highway.

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:08.930
Eliminate safety devices from #1 to #15.

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:11.260
Inner power supply complete.

00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:14.560
No problem with the inner power supply.

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:15.960
Roger that.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:18.340
Eva No. 1 to the vehicle room.

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:35.280
Path cleared. All green.

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:37.460
Preparations complete.

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:39.610
Roger.

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:40.800
It doesn't matter.

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:41.800
Of course.

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:45.430
As long as we don't defeat the Angel, we have no future.

00:21:45.430 --> 00:21:47.970
Ikari.

00:21:47.970 --> 00:21:51.810
Is this really all we need?

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.070
Depart!

00:21:53.070 --> 00:21:54.430
Gyaah!

00:22:26.590 --> 00:22:27.080
You can go in.

00:23:36.110 --> 00:23:39.980
Eva wins over the capital, but that didn't happen at the beginning of everything.

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:45.360
Shinji runs away from his father. Misato's arrogance makes him decide to save him.

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:47.630
Next time, "Unbeknownst to the Heavens."

00:23:47.630 --> 00:23:51.790
Next time, "Service! Service!"

00:23:51.790 --> 00:24:00.000
