00:24:07.640 --> 00:24:14.470
The show.

00:24:30.670 --> 00:24:53.650
The wind is blowing

00:25:38.380 --> 00:25:45.680
This program was brought to you by Kadokawa Shoten and Sega Enterprises.

00:25:54.540 --> 00:25:58.580
Eliminate Evangelion Unit 01! Lift off!

00:26:02.010 --> 00:26:05.280
Shinji, now you just have to think about walking.

00:26:05.280 --> 00:26:06.920
Walking...

00:26:08.230 --> 00:26:17.350
I walked!

00:26:40.450 --> 00:26:54.700
What about the defense system?

00:26:54.700 --> 00:26:56.210
The signal is not working.

00:26:56.210 --> 00:26:57.960
The field is open.

00:26:57.960 --> 00:26:59.120
Is it no good?

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:31.150
No damage.

00:27:31.150 --> 00:27:33.600
The control nerves will be separated one by one.

00:27:33.600 --> 00:27:35.840
Pirates, no response!

00:27:35.840 --> 00:27:37.460
Shinji!

00:28:09.400 --> 00:28:26.600
It's an unknown ceiling.

00:28:26.600 --> 00:28:28.180
A reoccurrence?

00:28:28.180 --> 00:28:29.670
It's too sudden.

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:31.960
It's the same as 15 years ago.

00:28:31.960 --> 00:28:35.950
You can visit us without any trouble.

00:28:35.950 --> 00:28:38.370
I can say it's a good thing.

00:28:38.370 --> 00:28:42.330
Our advance investment didn't go to waste.

00:28:42.330 --> 00:28:44.830
I don't know that yet.

00:28:44.830 --> 00:28:47.280
It's the same as a waste if it's not useful.

00:28:47.280 --> 00:28:54.180
Saio, the information operation of the capital that has become a fact of knowledge now.

00:28:54.180 --> 00:29:00.000
It's a problem if you don't handle the operation of NERV properly and quickly.

00:29:00.600 --> 00:29:03.490
The case has already been dealt with.

00:29:03.490 --> 00:29:04.740
Please rest assured.

00:29:04.740 --> 00:29:15.740
The announcement is scenario B-22.

00:29:15.740 --> 00:29:18.630
The truth is still in the dark.

00:29:18.630 --> 00:29:20.460
The Ministry of Defense was happy.

00:29:20.460 --> 00:29:22.380
They finally got a job.

00:29:22.380 --> 00:29:24.830
I'm happy, too.

00:29:24.830 --> 00:29:26.150
I wonder.

00:29:26.150 --> 00:29:29.050
Actually, everyone is scared.

00:29:29.050 --> 00:29:30.000
Of course.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:32.530
Well, that's right.

00:29:32.530 --> 00:29:34.930
But Ikari-kun,

00:29:34.930 --> 00:29:38.250
can you use Nerf a little better?

00:29:38.250 --> 00:29:40.250
The repair fee of the first machine,

00:29:40.250 --> 00:29:42.250
which you guys broke with Uijin,

00:29:42.250 --> 00:29:44.250
after the No. 0 machine,

00:29:44.250 --> 00:29:46.480
the country will be one.

00:29:46.480 --> 00:29:50.540
It seems that that toy was given to your son.

00:29:50.540 --> 00:29:51.500
People,

00:29:51.500 --> 00:29:52.640
time,

00:29:52.640 --> 00:29:53.650
and money.

00:29:53.650 --> 00:29:55.980
Do you realize how much you can use

00:29:55.980 --> 00:29:56.980
with your parents?

00:29:56.980 --> 00:30:00.000
And your job is not only this.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:01.290
No, it's not.

00:30:01.290 --> 00:30:02.900
The Human Restoration Project.

00:30:02.900 --> 00:30:05.420
This is your duty.

00:30:05.420 --> 00:30:06.440
That's right.

00:30:06.440 --> 00:30:12.020
That project is our only hope for this hopeless situation.

00:30:12.020 --> 00:30:13.760
Our only hope.

00:30:13.760 --> 00:30:15.000
In any case,

00:30:15.000 --> 00:30:19.670
the delay in the planning schedule for the return to the capital is not acceptable.

00:30:19.670 --> 00:30:22.550
Let's move on to the budget.

00:30:22.550 --> 00:30:25.410
Then the rest is the work of the committee.

00:30:25.410 --> 00:30:28.130
Hikari, you did a good job.

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:33.080
Ikari, you can't go back.

00:30:36.010 --> 00:30:38.520
I know.

00:30:38.520 --> 00:30:40.530
Humans don't have time.

00:31:08.440 --> 00:31:10.320
We are the magicians of humankind.

00:31:10.320 --> 00:31:12.340
It's truly the victory of science.

00:31:12.340 --> 00:31:15.530
Shinji-kun has noticed.

00:31:15.530 --> 00:31:17.660
So, what about Yodai?

00:31:17.660 --> 00:31:18.770
No sign of him.

00:31:18.770 --> 00:31:20.710
I can see a little confusion in his memory, though.

00:31:20.710 --> 00:31:23.110
Could it be that he has a mental health problem?

00:31:23.110 --> 00:31:26.270
He doesn't seem to be worried about that.

00:31:26.270 --> 00:31:28.820
I see.

00:31:28.820 --> 00:31:30.000
That's right.

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:31.620
It was all of a sudden, wasn't it?

00:31:31.620 --> 00:31:33.160
It's not impossible.

00:31:33.160 --> 00:31:35.790
It took a lot of pressure on my brain nerves.

00:31:35.790 --> 00:31:38.310
It's a mistake of the heart, isn't it?

00:32:06.080 --> 00:32:10.380
If Ever and this town are completely operational, we might be able to make it.

00:32:10.380 --> 00:32:12.540
Are you going to defeat the Apostles?

00:32:12.540 --> 00:32:14.160
You're as easygoing as ever.

00:32:14.160 --> 00:32:18.770
Oh, the Hopeful Observation is a must-have item for people to live on.

00:32:18.770 --> 00:32:21.260
That's right.

00:32:21.260 --> 00:32:23.520
That kind of place of yours is very helpful.

00:33:04.350 --> 00:33:05.810
It's good, isn't it?

00:33:05.810 --> 00:33:07.520
Instead of living together.

00:33:07.520 --> 00:33:09.450
For Ikari and the others,

00:33:09.450 --> 00:33:12.910
it's only natural that they don't live together.

00:33:12.910 --> 00:33:16.240
Rather, it's more unnatural to be together.

00:33:16.240 --> 00:33:18.600
Alone?

00:33:18.600 --> 00:33:19.660
That's right.

00:33:19.660 --> 00:33:22.390
His room will be the sixth block from here.

00:33:22.390 --> 00:33:23.840
No problem.

00:33:23.840 --> 00:33:24.670
Yes.

00:33:24.670 --> 00:33:27.530
Is that okay?

00:33:27.530 --> 00:33:28.790
Shinji...

00:33:28.790 --> 00:33:29.730
It's fine.

00:33:30.000 --> 00:33:33.740
It's always the same when you're alone.

00:33:33.740 --> 00:33:35.440
What did you say?

00:33:35.440 --> 00:33:40.280
That's why I made Shinji stay with me.

00:33:40.280 --> 00:33:41.680
I also got permission from the boss.

00:33:41.680 --> 00:33:45.300
You don't have to worry. I won't touch the kid.

00:33:45.300 --> 00:33:49.000
Of course you don't.

00:33:49.000 --> 00:33:52.510
As usual, you don't understand jokes.

00:33:52.510 --> 00:33:58.890
Well, I have to do it tonight.

00:34:00.090 --> 00:34:01.190
What do you want?

00:34:01.190 --> 00:34:04.520
Of course, it's a welcome party for the new resident.

00:34:04.520 --> 00:34:12.930
Are you going to be sent away?

00:34:12.930 --> 00:34:17.210
I didn't expect this place to really become a battlefield.

00:34:17.210 --> 00:34:19.040
I'm sorry.

00:34:19.040 --> 00:34:23.120
My husband told me to break up with the children and myself.

00:34:23.120 --> 00:34:24.830
Yeah.

00:34:24.830 --> 00:34:28.760
No matter how old you are, you can't do anything about it.

00:34:28.760 --> 00:34:30.000
The incident yesterday.

00:34:30.280 --> 00:34:32.280
Even if it's just a car, I'd get angry.

00:34:32.280 --> 00:34:34.120
Really.

00:34:34.120 --> 00:34:41.580
I'm sorry, but I'm going on a little trip.

00:34:41.580 --> 00:34:42.520
Where are you going?

00:34:42.520 --> 00:34:44.660
A good place.

00:34:44.660 --> 00:34:56.230
It's kind of a lonely town.

00:34:56.230 --> 00:34:57.560
It's time.

00:35:25.180 --> 00:35:26.150
It's growing.

00:35:41.800 --> 00:35:55.510
This is the capital's special fortress, the third Shintokyo city, our city, the city you protected.

00:36:09.050 --> 00:36:11.930
I think Shinji-kun's luggage has arrived.

00:36:11.930 --> 00:36:17.280
Actually, I just moved to this town the other day.

00:36:17.280 --> 00:36:19.260
Come in.

00:36:19.260 --> 00:36:22.760
Excuse me.

00:36:22.760 --> 00:36:26.500
Shinji-kun, this is your house.

00:36:34.670 --> 00:36:36.050
I'm home.

00:36:36.050 --> 00:36:37.200
Welcome home.

00:36:37.200 --> 00:36:44.060
Please don't worry about me.

00:36:44.060 --> 00:36:48.650
This is...

00:36:48.650 --> 00:36:55.600
Lai.

00:36:55.600 --> 00:36:57.740
Mori.

00:36:57.740 --> 00:36:58.740
Tsunami.

00:37:00.160 --> 00:37:03.270
I'm just having lunch. What kind of life is this?

00:37:03.270 --> 00:37:14.890
Where's the fridge over there?

00:37:14.890 --> 00:37:16.750
That's fine. I think it's still sleeping.

00:37:16.750 --> 00:37:19.380
Sleeping?

00:37:19.380 --> 00:37:23.510
Let's eat!

00:37:23.510 --> 00:37:25.510
Let's eat.

00:37:33.640 --> 00:37:37.430
I'm living for this moment in my life, aren't I?

00:37:37.430 --> 00:37:40.370
Aren't you going to eat?

00:37:40.370 --> 00:37:43.060
It's pretty good, though it's instant.

00:37:43.060 --> 00:37:45.010
No, umm...

00:37:45.010 --> 00:37:47.430
I'm not used to this kind of meal.

00:37:47.430 --> 00:37:48.790
You can't!

00:37:48.790 --> 00:37:50.390
You're going to hate it!

00:37:50.390 --> 00:37:52.920
No, I'm not!

00:37:52.920 --> 00:37:54.990
Umm...

00:37:54.990 --> 00:37:56.720
It's fun, isn't it?

00:37:56.720 --> 00:37:57.360
Yes.

00:37:57.360 --> 00:38:00.000
You're going to have a meal with someone else like this.

00:38:02.080 --> 00:38:02.600
Yes.

00:38:02.600 --> 00:38:06.090
Well then...

00:38:06.090 --> 00:38:07.560
Let's move on.

00:38:07.560 --> 00:38:09.700
Rock-paper-scissors!

00:38:09.700 --> 00:38:17.510
Shinji-kun!

00:38:17.510 --> 00:38:22.440
Alright! Now that we've decided on your life, it's all good, right?

00:38:22.440 --> 00:38:23.900
Yes.

00:38:23.900 --> 00:38:24.870
Well then...

00:38:24.870 --> 00:38:27.580
From now on, this is your house.

00:38:27.580 --> 00:38:29.890
You don't need to hold back at all.

00:38:31.240 --> 00:38:31.740
Yes.

00:38:31.740 --> 00:38:35.440
Come on, "yes, yes, yes, yes" is a new word, isn't it?

00:38:35.440 --> 00:38:37.250
Oh! It's here, isn't it?

00:38:37.250 --> 00:38:38.090
Shaki, Kusunan!

00:38:38.090 --> 00:38:39.250
Yes, Shaki, how is it?

00:38:39.250 --> 00:38:40.840
Yes.

00:38:40.840 --> 00:38:42.310
Well, that's fine.

00:38:42.310 --> 00:38:47.970
If you don't like it, go to the bath and wash it.

00:38:47.970 --> 00:38:50.100
Bath is the choice of life.

00:39:01.440 --> 00:39:02.080
What?

00:39:02.080 --> 00:39:08.260
Ah, him?

00:39:08.260 --> 00:39:10.340
He's a new type of hot spring penguin.

00:39:10.340 --> 00:39:12.230
What?

00:39:12.230 --> 00:39:22.500
His name is Pen-Pen.

00:39:22.500 --> 00:39:24.340
He's someone else's co-inhabitant.

00:39:24.340 --> 00:39:26.090
Anyway...

00:39:26.090 --> 00:39:27.400
Why don't we make the front harder?

00:39:34.250 --> 00:39:36.660
Did I overdo it a little too much?

00:39:36.660 --> 00:39:39.370
I might be the one being misled.

00:39:39.370 --> 00:39:45.330
Miss Katsuragi Misato, you're not a bad person.

00:39:45.330 --> 00:39:48.720
A bath is the choice of life.

00:39:48.720 --> 00:39:53.430
But I think it's better to remember bad things about a bath.

00:39:53.430 --> 00:39:58.520
Father and Ayanami Reika.

00:40:02.170 --> 00:40:04.380
How's Ray doing?

00:40:04.380 --> 00:40:09.400
He went to the hospital this afternoon, didn't he?

00:40:09.400 --> 00:40:12.330
He'll be fine in 20 days.

00:40:12.330 --> 00:40:16.510
Until then, they're planning to restart the Zero System.

00:40:16.510 --> 00:40:20.280
They must be in pain.

00:40:20.280 --> 00:40:23.020
There's no one else who can make Eva move.

00:40:23.020 --> 00:40:25.610
As long as she's alive, we'll have her do it.

00:40:25.610 --> 00:40:29.170
Does that have nothing to do with the children's will?

00:40:47.760 --> 00:40:50.130
Yes, he's looking at me like that.

00:40:50.670 --> 00:40:52.450
I wonder if he'll ride with me again.

00:40:53.500 --> 00:40:56.040
His maintenance is your job, isn't it?

00:40:57.270 --> 00:41:00.000
I'm scared. I don't know how to handle him.

00:41:00.350 --> 00:41:01.580
Are you crying already?

00:41:01.580 --> 00:41:04.040
You just said you were going to take it from me.

00:41:04.040 --> 00:41:06.240
Shut up!

00:41:06.240 --> 00:41:11.310
At that time, I was looking at Shinji as my own tool.

00:41:11.310 --> 00:41:13.670
Just like Ritsuko.

00:41:13.670 --> 00:41:19.240
I'm not happy to say I defeated him.

00:41:19.240 --> 00:41:24.320
This is also an unknown ceiling.

00:41:24.320 --> 00:41:28.350
Of course.

00:41:28.350 --> 00:41:30.000
It's a place I know in this city.

00:41:30.160 --> 00:41:32.390
It's nowhere to be found.

00:41:32.390 --> 00:41:36.820
This is your house.

00:41:36.820 --> 00:41:38.580
Why is it here?

00:42:01.280 --> 00:42:02.960
The head is damaged, no damage!

00:42:02.960 --> 00:42:04.770
There's a problem with the operation!

00:42:04.770 --> 00:42:05.730
What's the situation?

00:42:05.730 --> 00:42:08.610
The synchro graph is reversed, the pulse is reversed!

00:42:08.610 --> 00:42:10.340
Stop the circuit.

00:42:10.340 --> 00:42:11.190
It's no good!

00:42:11.190 --> 00:42:13.220
We won't receive the signal rejection!

00:42:13.220 --> 00:42:14.610
Where's Shinji-kun?

00:42:14.610 --> 00:42:16.830
There's no response from the monitor! No sign of the warrior!

00:42:16.830 --> 00:42:18.450
Unit 1, completely silent!

00:42:18.450 --> 00:42:19.570
Misato!

00:42:19.570 --> 00:42:21.380
That's as far as it goes.

00:42:21.380 --> 00:42:22.510
Stop the operation!

00:42:22.510 --> 00:42:24.140
Pilot protection is the top priority!

00:42:24.140 --> 00:42:25.800
The flamethrower must be ejected!

00:42:25.800 --> 00:42:26.560
It's no good!

00:42:26.560 --> 00:42:28.110
It's completely uncontrollable!

00:42:28.110 --> 00:42:29.280
What did you say?!

00:42:40.110 --> 00:42:40.660
Gokar.

00:43:05.280 --> 00:43:06.120
I won.

00:43:06.120 --> 00:43:07.860
Huh?

00:43:07.860 --> 00:43:14.050
AT Field!

00:43:14.050 --> 00:43:20.870
No good! As long as we have the AT Field, we can't contact the city!

00:43:20.870 --> 00:43:23.000
Turn! Reversal!

00:43:27.240 --> 00:43:29.570
The first unit also deployed the AT Field!

00:43:30.160 --> 00:43:32.110
I will neutralize the space-time.

00:43:32.110 --> 00:43:34.480
No, it's being diluted.

00:43:34.480 --> 00:43:38.210
Oh...

00:43:38.210 --> 00:43:41.120
I will easily destroy the AT field.

00:44:50.410 --> 00:44:50.930
Thank you, Eva.

00:45:05.150 --> 00:45:07.400
Check the location.

00:45:33.230 --> 00:45:33.730
*Gasp*

00:45:33.730 --> 00:45:34.310
*Gasps*

00:45:34.310 --> 00:45:34.810
*Screams*

00:45:34.810 --> 00:45:35.310
*Screams*

00:45:35.310 --> 00:45:55.270
Shinji-kun, I'm opening it.

00:45:55.270 --> 00:45:55.770
*Sigh*

00:45:55.770 --> 00:46:00.000
I forgot to tell you something.

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:05.690
I know, but you've done a great job of being praised by the people.

00:46:05.690 --> 00:46:08.180
You can be proud of yourself.

00:46:08.180 --> 00:46:12.400
Good night, Shinji.

00:46:12.400 --> 00:46:17.440
Good luck.

00:47:23.100 --> 00:47:27.570
She didn't expect her friend to be born the moment she was sent into the situation.

00:47:27.570 --> 00:47:30.000
However, the fact that she was a pilot of EVA

00:47:30.030 --> 00:47:38.540
This program was brought to you by Kadokawa Bookstore and Sega Enterprises.

00:49:24.380 --> 00:49:30.000
This program is brought to you by SEGA Enterprises.

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:38.500
This is brought to you by Niharawa Bookstore.

00:49:38.500 --> 00:49:41.230
Good morning, Shinji. How are you feeling?

00:49:41.230 --> 00:49:44.300
I'm used to it. I don't think it's too bad.

00:49:44.300 --> 00:49:45.640
That's fine.

00:49:45.640 --> 00:49:52.340
The location of Eva's appearance, emergency power supply, arrangement of closed-door buildings, and recovery spots are all in your head, aren't they?

00:49:52.340 --> 00:49:53.220
Probably.

00:49:53.220 --> 00:49:55.740
Then, I'll review it one more time.

00:49:55.740 --> 00:50:00.000
Usually, Eva operates with power supply from the priority.

00:50:00.090 --> 00:50:08.110
If you switch to the internal battery, you can use it for a full 1 minute, but if you use the gain, you can only use it for a maximum of 5 minutes.

00:50:08.110 --> 00:50:10.660
This is the limit of our science.

00:50:10.660 --> 00:50:11.930
Do you understand?

00:50:11.930 --> 00:50:13.210
Yes.

00:50:13.210 --> 00:50:16.200
Then, let's continue yesterday's induction mode.

00:50:21.160 --> 00:50:23.840
Put the target in the center.

00:50:23.840 --> 00:50:30.000
Switch on.

00:50:31.180 --> 00:50:47.240
Switch.

00:50:47.240 --> 00:50:50.390
You really got on my nerves, Shinji-kun.

00:50:50.390 --> 00:50:52.880
I obey what people say.

00:50:52.880 --> 00:50:54.930
Isn't that her first-hand technique?

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:15.720
Put the target in the center and switch.

00:51:32.650 --> 00:51:35.540
Hey, Misato-san, it's morning already.

00:51:35.540 --> 00:51:39.840
I arrived just a moment ago.

00:51:39.840 --> 00:51:42.730
I just need to go to bed by evening today.

00:51:42.730 --> 00:51:44.950
So let me sleep.

00:51:44.950 --> 00:51:46.810
Then, I'll...

00:51:46.810 --> 00:51:49.550
Today is Thursday, right?

00:51:49.550 --> 00:51:52.020
Can I have your mail?

00:51:52.020 --> 00:51:54.120
Yes.

00:51:54.120 --> 00:51:57.680
Are you used to school?

00:51:57.680 --> 00:51:58.870
Yes.

00:51:58.870 --> 00:52:00.000
I see.

00:52:00.510 --> 00:52:01.900
Have a good day.

00:52:01.900 --> 00:52:03.330
I'm off.

00:52:03.330 --> 00:52:23.110
I'll see you later.

00:52:23.110 --> 00:52:24.020
How's it going?

00:52:24.020 --> 00:52:25.700
How's it going with your boyfriend?

00:52:30.030 --> 00:52:35.300
For the last two weeks, I haven't gotten a call from anyone.

00:52:35.300 --> 00:52:36.610
A call?

00:52:36.610 --> 00:52:40.860
It's a must-have item, so I gave it to you a long time ago.

00:52:40.860 --> 00:52:46.320
I don't feel like I've been using it myself or getting a call from anyone.

00:52:46.320 --> 00:52:49.870
Maybe he doesn't have any friends.

00:52:49.870 --> 00:52:56.110
Shinji, you have a bad personality when it comes to making friends.

00:52:56.110 --> 00:52:58.570
Do you know the story of the "Yamaarashi Dilemma"?

00:52:58.570 --> 00:53:00.000
"Yamaarashi"?

00:53:00.640 --> 00:53:04.720
In the case of a mountain storm, even if you want to convey your warmth to the other person,

00:53:04.720 --> 00:53:08.670
the more you pull yourself together, the more you hurt each other with the thorns all over your body.

00:53:08.670 --> 00:53:11.090
I can say the same thing to humans.

00:53:11.090 --> 00:53:17.040
Shinji-kun right now must be frightened by pain somewhere in his heart and becoming cowardly.

00:53:17.040 --> 00:53:24.000
Well, when you grow up, you keep getting closer and away from each other,

00:53:24.000 --> 00:53:27.010
and the distance between you and each other doesn't hurt much.

00:53:37.580 --> 00:53:46.350
What's wrong, director? Did you deliver the print from yesterday?

00:53:46.350 --> 00:53:52.650
Uh, yeah. It seems like it was on leave at that time.

00:53:52.650 --> 00:53:57.920
Aida-kun, you're close with Suzuhara, right? Aren't you worried about him taking two weeks off?

00:53:57.920 --> 00:54:00.000
Did he get hurt?

00:54:00.120 --> 00:54:02.290
What? In the robot incident?

00:54:02.290 --> 00:54:04.340
There wasn't even one person on TV.

00:54:04.340 --> 00:54:05.340
No way.

00:54:05.340 --> 00:54:07.700
You saw Takanosuyama's bombing site, right?

00:54:07.700 --> 00:54:10.230
Not only Iruma and Komatsu,

00:54:10.230 --> 00:54:13.380
but even Misawa and Kyushu's troops are on the move.

00:54:13.380 --> 00:54:16.580
It's impossible for 10 or 20 people to survive.

00:54:16.580 --> 00:54:18.130
They're dead.

00:54:18.630 --> 00:54:20.860
Toji?

00:54:20.860 --> 00:54:21.880
Suzuhara?

00:54:22.840 --> 00:54:26.660
What? It looks like we've lost a lot of people.

00:54:26.660 --> 00:54:28.590
It's a disaster. A disaster.

00:54:28.590 --> 00:54:30.000
Everyone has been transferred.

00:54:30.540 --> 00:54:33.670
It's going to be such a big war in the city.

00:54:33.670 --> 00:54:36.330
You're the only one who's happy.

00:54:36.330 --> 00:54:38.250
I can see a live Donpachi.

00:54:38.250 --> 00:54:39.540
Yeah.

00:54:39.540 --> 00:54:40.960
What were you doing back then?

00:54:40.960 --> 00:54:42.730
I took a break like this.

00:54:42.730 --> 00:54:46.400
I ate a firecracker because of the commotion the other day.

00:54:46.400 --> 00:54:49.520
My sister.

00:54:49.520 --> 00:54:50.940
My sister.

00:54:50.940 --> 00:54:53.280
She was killed by Gargi.

00:54:53.280 --> 00:54:54.800
Her life was saved.

00:54:54.800 --> 00:54:56.810
She's been hospitalized all the time.

00:54:56.810 --> 00:55:00.000
I'm going to set up a research institute for my father-in-law and grandfather.

00:55:00.090 --> 00:55:03.170
I can't leave the office now.

00:55:03.170 --> 00:55:06.470
If I'm not there, he'll be alone in the hospital.

00:55:06.470 --> 00:55:10.860
But that robot pilot is really bad!

00:55:10.860 --> 00:55:12.860
I'm really angry!

00:55:12.860 --> 00:55:15.780
My allies are rampaging and I'm going to kill them!

00:55:15.780 --> 00:55:18.770
That's it, but did you hear the rumors of the transfer student?

00:55:18.770 --> 00:55:20.930
Transfer student?

00:55:20.930 --> 00:55:22.320
Look, that guy.

00:55:22.320 --> 00:55:27.420
He's the one who entered while Toji was on vacation.

00:55:27.420 --> 00:55:29.540
It's after that incident.

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:33.130
Don't you think so?

00:55:33.130 --> 00:55:43.520
In this way, humanity has faced its greatest trial.

00:55:43.520 --> 00:55:50.580
In the last year of the 20th century, a large amount of meteorites that came from space collided with the South Pole.

00:55:50.580 --> 00:55:54.560
It took the whole continent of ice and kidnapped it.

00:55:54.560 --> 00:56:00.000
The ocean's water level rose, the Earth's axis bent, and the existence of life was threatened.

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:03.300
abnormal weather attacks all over the world.

00:56:03.300 --> 00:56:06.560
And along with a few thousand species,

00:56:06.560 --> 00:56:10.310
half of humanity was lost forever.

00:56:10.310 --> 00:56:14.400
This is the so-called Second Impact in the world.

00:56:14.400 --> 00:56:17.760
The collapse of the economy, the civil war, the civil war,

00:56:17.760 --> 00:56:21.950
and then the people who survived saw a hellish hell.

00:56:21.950 --> 00:56:24.460
But 15 years after that,

00:56:24.460 --> 00:56:29.730
in just 15 years, we were able to reach this point.

00:56:31.020 --> 00:56:43.970
We humans are excellent, but we can say that your parents' blood, sweat, tears, and efforts are precious.

00:56:46.770 --> 00:56:51.190
I used to live on the Nemu River back then, but now...

00:56:51.190 --> 00:56:53.910
Hey, everyone! You're in the middle of training, right?

00:56:53.910 --> 00:56:58.670
- Nishikiru! - It's okay, it's okay!

00:56:58.670 --> 00:57:00.000
It's not okay!

00:57:03.420 --> 00:57:08.580
What about the test? Wasn't it scary? How was the seat?

00:57:08.580 --> 00:57:11.560
No, that's a secret.

00:57:11.560 --> 00:57:19.110
I don't know, but everyone was listening to Eva.

00:57:19.110 --> 00:57:21.110
What about the special move?

00:57:21.110 --> 00:57:26.970
It's called something knife, and the vibration is like a super sound wave.

00:57:26.970 --> 00:57:29.860
It's amazing. It's the pride of the school.

00:57:32.360 --> 00:57:34.440
Is there a way?

00:57:34.440 --> 00:57:38.630
Mikami, where are you going?

00:57:38.630 --> 00:57:40.530
-Kiisou! -Ren!

00:57:40.530 --> 00:57:43.800
Oh no! Everyone, do it properly until the end!

00:57:43.800 --> 00:57:55.380
Sorry, transfer student.

00:57:55.380 --> 00:57:57.750
I have to hit you.

00:57:57.750 --> 00:57:59.640
I don't feel like hitting you.

00:58:02.200 --> 00:58:08.870
Sorry. I got hurt by that guy's sister during the fight. That's why...

00:58:08.870 --> 00:58:14.200
It's not a joke.

00:58:44.650 --> 00:58:47.700
We're going to the emergency room.

00:59:25.080 --> 00:59:29.410
- We've invaded the area. - All hands, place the first battle formation. - Roger.

01:00:14.650 --> 01:00:21.440
All communications to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs have been completed.

01:00:21.440 --> 01:00:23.480
Where are the combatants and civilians?

01:00:23.480 --> 01:00:26.310
We have already received a report that they have been evacuated.

01:00:34.160 --> 01:00:35.540
Again?

01:00:35.540 --> 01:00:37.750
Again, just the characters?

01:00:37.750 --> 01:00:40.180
That's what we call media perfection.

01:00:40.180 --> 01:00:42.840
They don't let us, the private sector, see it.

01:00:42.840 --> 01:00:45.240
Even though it's such a big event.

01:00:45.240 --> 01:00:52.400
The fourth death and the arrival of Commander Ikari's dogma.

01:00:52.400 --> 01:00:53.910
That was surprisingly quick.

01:00:53.910 --> 01:00:56.120
Last time, it was a 15-year blank.

01:00:56.120 --> 01:00:58.760
This time, it's only been three weeks.

01:00:58.760 --> 01:01:00.000
Our convenience is...

01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:02.150
A type of person that is hated by women.

01:01:06.400 --> 01:01:11.940
Waste of money.

01:01:11.940 --> 01:01:15.110
A request for Evangelion to be dispatched from the committee again.

01:01:15.110 --> 01:01:17.470
They're so noisy.

01:01:17.470 --> 01:01:20.420
Even if you don't tell me, I'll let you go.

01:01:31.850 --> 01:01:35.030
Even though my dad's not here, I wonder why he's on the train again.

01:01:35.030 --> 01:01:40.720
Even though he got hit by a person.

01:01:40.720 --> 01:01:46.650
Hey, we need to talk to you two.

01:01:46.650 --> 01:01:47.550
What is it?

01:01:47.550 --> 01:01:48.710
It's a bit...

01:01:48.710 --> 01:01:51.860
I guess we can't.

01:01:51.860 --> 01:01:53.330
Director!

01:01:53.330 --> 01:01:54.330
What?

01:01:54.330 --> 01:01:56.560
The two of us need to go to the toilet.

01:01:56.560 --> 01:01:59.410
Hey, you need to take care of this properly.

01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:01.560
So, what do you want?

01:02:01.560 --> 01:02:04.410
I want to see you at least once before you die.

01:02:04.410 --> 01:02:05.790
The one up there?

01:02:05.790 --> 01:02:09.330
I don't know when the enemy will come again.

01:02:09.330 --> 01:02:11.670
Kensuke, you...

01:02:11.670 --> 01:02:14.280
If you miss this time, or if you don't...

01:02:14.280 --> 01:02:17.270
Please help me remove the lock.

01:02:17.270 --> 01:02:18.970
If you go outside, you'll die.

01:02:18.970 --> 01:02:20.860
I don't know if I'll be here.

01:02:20.860 --> 01:02:23.090
If you're going to die, you'd better watch me.

01:02:23.090 --> 01:02:24.110
Idiot.

01:02:24.110 --> 01:02:26.370
Why do you have a Nerf gun?

01:02:26.370 --> 01:02:29.210
What is that Nerf war weapon?

01:02:29.210 --> 01:02:30.000
That transfer...

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:31.890
It's a humanoid robot.

01:02:31.890 --> 01:02:34.250
He was protecting us the other day.

01:02:34.250 --> 01:02:37.410
He hit it like that, and twice.

01:02:37.410 --> 01:02:42.570
If he says he won't ride the robot, we're going to die.

01:02:42.570 --> 01:02:47.000
At that time, we had a duty to watch over his fight.

01:02:47.000 --> 01:02:48.940
It can't be helped.

01:02:48.940 --> 01:02:57.270
You're really honest about your desires.

01:02:57.270 --> 01:02:58.680
All right.

01:03:00.060 --> 01:03:03.450
The enemy's AT field has been destroyed, the Palette is still alive.

01:03:03.450 --> 01:03:05.820
As usual, you'll be fine.

01:03:05.820 --> 01:03:07.150
Yes, ma'am.

01:03:07.150 --> 01:03:08.160
Depart!

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:31.860
I've been waiting for this!

01:03:31.860 --> 01:03:32.930
I've been waiting for this!

01:03:32.930 --> 01:03:48.480
Switch to the control center.

01:03:48.480 --> 01:03:49.480
Switch to the control center.

01:03:49.480 --> 01:03:50.650
Yes.

01:03:50.650 --> 01:04:00.000
I can't see the enemy in the blaze!

01:04:10.970 --> 01:04:13.110
Naya, she's already been killed!

01:04:13.110 --> 01:04:14.250
It's okay.

01:04:14.250 --> 01:04:22.050
I'll give you a spare rifle.

01:04:22.050 --> 01:04:23.410
Well...

01:04:23.410 --> 01:04:25.970
I wonder if she really got hit.

01:04:25.970 --> 01:04:27.580
Shut up, Naya!

01:04:32.360 --> 01:04:33.810
-

01:05:31.530 --> 01:05:43.040
Why are you fighting?

01:05:43.040 --> 01:05:45.120
It's because we're here.

01:05:45.120 --> 01:05:47.130
We can't move freely.

01:05:47.130 --> 01:06:00.000
We have to recover.

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:02.500
After that, we will withdraw for now and come back again.

01:06:02.860 --> 01:06:06.360
Do you think that you can bring a person who doesn't have permission to the entry plan?

01:06:07.380 --> 01:06:08.380
I will allow it.

01:06:08.880 --> 01:06:10.380
This is an unlawful act, Katsura Gitchi.

01:06:12.850 --> 01:06:15.300
There are only three minutes left until the activity limit of Unit 01.

01:06:15.770 --> 01:06:17.270
Hold EVA with the current order.

01:06:17.750 --> 01:06:19.750
During that time, the entry plan will be dispatched. Hurry up!

01:06:26.010 --> 01:06:28.020
What? It's a mistake, isn't it?

01:06:28.520 --> 01:06:30.000
The camera! The camera!

01:06:30.160 --> 01:06:32.120
*cough*

01:06:32.120 --> 01:06:38.640
I've put two things in the club.

01:06:38.640 --> 01:06:41.190
There's a noise in the nerve pulse.

01:06:41.190 --> 01:06:43.440
*cough*

01:07:01.280 --> 01:07:02.260
We can't run away!

01:07:02.980 --> 01:07:04.420
Progressive Knife, Sophie!

01:07:41.680 --> 01:07:42.200
Deep.

01:08:10.910 --> 01:08:12.550
Unit 01 has stopped operation.

01:08:12.550 --> 01:08:14.820
The target is completely silent.

01:08:57.320 --> 01:09:00.000
It's been three days...

01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:03.560
After we were scolded by Kotterito?

01:09:03.560 --> 01:09:06.730
After he started coming to school.

01:09:06.730 --> 01:09:08.800
Who was he?

01:09:08.800 --> 01:09:10.860
A transfer student, a transfer student.

01:09:10.860 --> 01:09:13.290
He's been nagging me since then.

01:09:13.290 --> 01:09:14.210
Are you worried?

01:09:14.210 --> 01:09:17.190
No, I'm not worried.

01:09:17.190 --> 01:09:21.000
He was clumsy at the time, but he was stubborn.

01:09:21.000 --> 01:09:24.610
After that, I should have apologized even if I was about to break up.

01:09:24.610 --> 01:09:26.640
I didn't even bother for three days.

01:09:26.640 --> 01:09:30.000
Here, a transfer student's phone number.

01:09:31.210 --> 01:09:33.270
If you're worried, why don't you try it?

01:11:08.480 --> 01:11:12.070
Shinji escapes from Misato without being able to overcome his heart.

01:11:12.070 --> 01:11:15.020
But the organization brings the boy back easily.

01:11:15.020 --> 01:11:17.290
There was no kind word there.

01:11:17.290 --> 01:11:19.970
Next time, "After the rain escaped."

01:11:19.970 --> 01:11:24.460
Next time, "Service! Service!"

01:11:24.460 --> 01:11:30.000
This program is brought to you by SEGA ENTERPRISES.

01:11:30.060 --> 01:11:40.310
ーSponsored by Showa Shotenー

01:13:10.490 --> 01:13:17.790
This program was brought to you by Kadokawa Shoten and SEGA Enterprises.

01:13:40.140 --> 01:13:44.980
I wonder if he's going to take a day off again today.

01:13:44.980 --> 01:13:49.420
Shinji, wake up!

01:13:49.420 --> 01:13:51.240
How long are you going to stay in school?

01:13:51.240 --> 01:13:52.650
It's already the fifth day.

01:13:52.650 --> 01:13:54.780
The first grade is completely cured.

01:13:54.780 --> 01:13:57.610
What are you, a pilot, going to do with that?

01:13:57.610 --> 01:13:58.480
Shinji!

01:14:16.380 --> 01:14:19.200
It's not impossible to go home, is it?

01:14:30.990 --> 01:14:31.990
Shinji-kun?

01:14:31.990 --> 01:14:36.960
Uh, um...

01:14:36.960 --> 01:14:39.960
I'm Aida and Suzuhara, in the same class as Ikari-kun.

01:14:39.960 --> 01:14:42.130
Aida-kun and Suzuhara-kun.

01:14:42.130 --> 01:14:45.050
Yes, I'm Suzuhara.

01:14:45.050 --> 01:14:48.380
Ah, did you get into the entry plug of Unit 01?

01:14:48.380 --> 01:14:51.430
Yes, that theory caused a lot of trouble.

01:14:51.430 --> 01:14:56.340
Actually, Ikari-kun has been resting for a long time since then,

01:14:56.340 --> 01:14:59.240
so I was worried about him, so I came to see him.

01:14:59.240 --> 01:15:00.000
Shinji-kun...

01:15:00.030 --> 01:15:02.850
Right now I'm at NERV's training facility.

01:15:02.850 --> 01:15:04.850
Ah, is that so?

01:15:04.850 --> 01:15:07.780
Ah, this is the print that was on the desk, for Ikari-kun.

01:15:07.780 --> 01:15:11.230
Sorry for the trouble. Thank you.

01:15:11.230 --> 01:15:13.280
Well, we'll excuse ourselves.

01:15:13.280 --> 01:15:15.220
Please tell Ikari-kun about this.

01:15:15.220 --> 01:15:17.490
Yes, I will.

01:15:17.490 --> 01:15:24.810
See you.

01:15:24.810 --> 01:15:27.150
This is unexpected.

01:15:27.150 --> 01:15:29.550
He was a very special person.

01:16:53.000 --> 01:16:54.830
Thank you very much.

01:16:54.830 --> 01:16:59.260
This train will go to Tokyo Station and will be a remodeled train.

01:17:00.570 --> 01:17:04.580
"Please make sure you don't forget anything."

01:17:04.580 --> 01:17:12.370
"I have to go home."

01:17:12.370 --> 01:17:13.960
"Sister, I'm here!"

01:17:13.960 --> 01:17:15.260
"Sister, I'm here!"

01:17:15.260 --> 01:17:20.940
"It's really cheap!"

01:17:20.940 --> 01:17:25.210
"You couldn't do it?"

01:17:25.210 --> 01:17:26.070
"That's right."

01:17:26.070 --> 01:17:27.920
"The object with a diameter of tens of millimeters..."

01:17:27.920 --> 01:17:30.000
"Has a speed of tens of percent of the speed."

01:17:33.100 --> 01:17:42.450
We couldn't stop it!

01:17:42.450 --> 01:17:47.650
It's no use! The tsunami's coming!

01:17:47.650 --> 01:17:49.650
It's approaching at 230mph!

01:17:49.650 --> 01:17:54.070
Teacher! Let's escape!

01:17:54.070 --> 01:17:58.420
We've got to find a way to look at the world's hell!

01:20:05.150 --> 01:20:07.270
You're 14 years old, aren't you?

01:20:07.270 --> 01:20:12.160
It's really hard to carry the burden of humanity.

01:20:12.160 --> 01:20:18.270
But we have to entrust the control of EVA to 14-year-old children.

01:20:18.270 --> 01:20:19.850
I know.

01:20:19.850 --> 01:20:23.290
So, did you get a call from Shinji?

01:20:23.290 --> 01:20:27.160
No.

01:20:27.160 --> 01:20:29.190
No.

01:20:29.190 --> 01:20:30.000
He...

01:20:30.000 --> 01:20:31.570
I might not be able to go back anymore.

01:20:31.570 --> 01:20:33.270
What are you going to do?

01:20:33.270 --> 01:20:34.770
Nothing.

01:20:34.770 --> 01:20:37.460
If I can't go back, that might be better.

01:20:37.460 --> 01:20:42.520
Noz, after the battle the other day...

01:20:42.520 --> 01:20:46.520
Why did you ignore my orders?

01:20:46.520 --> 01:20:48.760
I'm sorry.

01:20:48.760 --> 01:20:52.310
I'm responsible for your strategy, right?

01:20:52.310 --> 01:20:52.980
Yes.

01:20:52.980 --> 01:20:56.370
You have a duty to obey my orders.

01:20:56.370 --> 01:20:57.160
You understand, right?

01:20:57.160 --> 01:20:57.800
Yes.

01:20:57.800 --> 01:21:00.000
So that this kind of thing doesn't happen again,

01:21:00.090 --> 01:21:01.010
Yes.

01:21:01.010 --> 01:21:03.500
You really understand, don't you?

01:21:03.500 --> 01:21:04.590
Yes.

01:21:04.590 --> 01:21:09.320
You know, it's not like you can just say "yes" to anything.

01:21:09.320 --> 01:21:11.500
I understand.

01:21:11.500 --> 01:21:12.840
It's fine now, isn't it?

01:21:12.840 --> 01:21:14.480
I won.

01:21:14.480 --> 01:21:18.720
It would be easier if you just put it on the surface, right?

01:21:18.720 --> 01:21:21.780
If you ride on the e-bike with that feeling, you'll die!

01:21:21.780 --> 01:21:24.710
It's fine, that's fine.

01:21:24.710 --> 01:21:29.730
I want to say that it's a good resolution, but if you think you'll be praised, it's a big mistake.

01:21:30.000 --> 01:21:31.210
Yes, Shinji-kun.

01:21:31.210 --> 01:21:36.610
No matter how much they praise me, I'm the only one who can get on, right?

01:21:36.610 --> 01:21:38.500
I'll get on.

01:21:38.500 --> 01:21:42.820
I see.

01:21:42.820 --> 01:21:46.840
If getting on EVA is the only pain for that girl,

01:21:46.840 --> 01:21:49.890
then it's better not to get on.

01:21:49.890 --> 01:21:51.220
You'll definitely die.

01:21:51.220 --> 01:21:56.260
But, you need a pilot.

01:21:56.260 --> 01:21:56.980
Da-da-da-da-da-da-

01:22:01.310 --> 01:22:03.350
Commander Shou!

01:22:03.350 --> 01:22:06.210
Go, Aida, go!

01:22:06.210 --> 01:22:11.490
But I can't leave you alone, Commander Shou!

01:22:11.490 --> 01:22:12.580
Idiot!

01:22:12.580 --> 01:22:22.960
Argh!

01:22:22.960 --> 01:22:30.000
All right.

01:22:30.000 --> 01:22:32.630
Ikari!

01:22:32.630 --> 01:22:52.700
That guy from back in the day, he was reflecting on himself.

01:22:52.700 --> 01:22:55.300
I heard he was lectured by his sister.

01:22:55.300 --> 01:22:59.440
He said, "That robot was the one who saved us."

01:23:00.000 --> 01:23:04.350
I don't want to be lectured by elementary and middle schoolers.

01:23:04.350 --> 01:23:14.430
You know, it's nice at night, because that noisy cicada doesn't cry.

01:23:14.430 --> 01:23:18.970
I was glad it was quiet when I was a kid, but it's getting more and more every year.

01:23:18.970 --> 01:23:22.530
Misato-san said that the ecosystem is back.

01:23:22.530 --> 01:23:27.360
Oh, Misato-san. I'm so jealous.

01:23:27.360 --> 01:23:30.000
I'm so jealous of living with such a beautiful lady.

01:23:30.000 --> 01:23:37.760
I can control Evangelion, and I want to control Evangelion as I please, even if it's just once!

01:23:37.760 --> 01:23:42.670
You shouldn't. I'm worried about your mother.

01:23:42.670 --> 01:23:54.770
Yeah, that's fine. I'm not like that. I'm the same as Ikari. You're going to eat, aren't you?

01:23:54.770 --> 01:24:00.000
Yeah. Do you always do things like this?

01:24:00.510 --> 01:24:01.640
Well, yeah.

01:24:01.640 --> 01:24:04.910
It's a training for when you become a guerrilla soldier.

01:24:04.910 --> 01:24:07.510
What can you do with a toy like this?

01:24:07.510 --> 01:24:09.160
You just do it because you like it.

01:24:09.160 --> 01:24:28.100
Oh!

01:24:34.160 --> 01:24:36.690
You're Ikari Shinji, aren't you?

01:24:36.690 --> 01:24:37.980
Yes.

01:24:37.980 --> 01:24:40.530
You're from the NERV Security Security Department.

01:24:40.530 --> 01:24:43.510
By applying for the 8th Security Order,

01:24:43.510 --> 01:24:45.820
I'll transfer you to the headquarters.

01:24:45.820 --> 01:24:47.110
Is that okay?

01:24:47.110 --> 01:24:50.420
Yes.

01:24:50.420 --> 01:24:52.900
And you?

01:24:52.900 --> 01:24:55.310
You're just watching without saying a word!

01:24:55.310 --> 01:24:56.630
No matter what you say,

01:24:56.630 --> 01:24:59.880
the NERV Security Security Department is a professional.

01:25:00.000 --> 01:25:01.860
What the hell are you talking about?

01:25:01.860 --> 01:25:04.700
Do you still have a short-term plan?

01:25:04.700 --> 01:25:06.740
No, I can't do that.

01:25:06.740 --> 01:25:09.470
I'm an idiot who can't win a fight.

01:25:09.470 --> 01:25:22.890
The short-term plan has nothing to do with it.

01:25:22.890 --> 01:25:24.610
For a while.

01:25:24.610 --> 01:25:25.500
Yes.

01:25:25.500 --> 01:25:30.000
Did you feel better after walking with me for the past two days?

01:25:31.280 --> 01:25:33.580
The EVA is ready.

01:25:33.580 --> 01:25:35.410
Will you ride it?

01:25:35.410 --> 01:25:37.580
Won't you ride it?

01:25:37.580 --> 01:25:43.910
You're not going to scold me about Ieda, are you?

01:25:43.910 --> 01:25:45.630
Of course not.

01:25:45.630 --> 01:25:48.920
Misato-san is someone else.

01:25:48.920 --> 01:25:51.120
If I say I'm not going to ride it,

01:25:51.120 --> 01:25:53.460
what will you do about Unit 01?

01:25:53.460 --> 01:25:56.390
You're going to ride it, aren't you?

01:25:56.390 --> 01:25:58.350
You're not going to ride it?

01:25:58.350 --> 01:26:00.000
There's no way I can do that.

01:26:00.000 --> 01:26:03.170
I don't want to push everything on her.

01:26:03.170 --> 01:26:05.660
It's okay. I'll get on.

01:26:05.660 --> 01:26:08.040
You don't want to get on?

01:26:08.040 --> 01:26:09.040
That's right.

01:26:09.040 --> 01:26:11.310
First of all, it's not for me.

01:26:11.310 --> 01:26:15.240
But Ayanami, Misato-san, Ritsuko-san...

01:26:15.240 --> 01:26:17.450
Stop it!

01:26:17.450 --> 01:26:19.450
It has nothing to do with people!

01:26:19.450 --> 01:26:21.450
If you don't like it, get out of here!

01:26:21.450 --> 01:26:23.450
Forget about Eva and us!

01:26:23.450 --> 01:26:25.870
Go back to your normal life!

01:26:25.870 --> 01:26:29.920
It's a nuisance to get on with feelings like yours!

01:26:41.580 --> 01:26:45.290
The Third Children will leave the Third Shintokyo tomorrow.

01:26:45.290 --> 01:26:48.180
Then, we'll rewrite the data of Unit 01 to 0.

01:26:48.180 --> 01:26:49.140
But...

01:26:49.590 --> 01:26:52.590
According to the results of Unit 0's restart experiment,

01:26:52.590 --> 01:26:54.480
we'll move on to the experiment in Unit 01.

01:27:00.410 --> 01:27:02.660
According to the report of the Marduk,

01:27:02.660 --> 01:27:05.520
the Force Children have not been found yet.

01:27:05.520 --> 01:27:10.370
Does that mean the pilot's replenishment will not work?

01:27:10.370 --> 01:27:14.260
Where is Misato-san?

01:27:14.260 --> 01:27:15.810
Let's say goodbye.

01:27:15.810 --> 01:27:18.570
You are no longer a NERV person.

01:27:18.570 --> 01:27:20.900
I can't tell you anything.

01:27:35.080 --> 01:27:37.000
Hikari, I forgot something!

01:27:37.000 --> 01:27:48.720
Ah!

01:27:48.720 --> 01:27:53.000
May I?

01:27:53.000 --> 01:27:56.890
Thank you.

01:27:56.890 --> 01:27:59.280
Hoji, eat up.

01:28:02.680 --> 01:28:05.930
Ikari, it's my fault for hitting both of you.

01:28:05.930 --> 01:28:07.520
Hit my child too!

01:28:07.520 --> 01:28:09.190
I can't do that!

01:28:09.190 --> 01:28:10.030
Please!

01:28:10.030 --> 01:28:11.850
If you don't do it, I'll get mad!

01:28:11.850 --> 01:28:14.020
He's such an embarrassing guy.

01:28:14.020 --> 01:28:17.380
If you're going to settle with that, I'll hit you.

01:28:17.380 --> 01:28:19.040
But...

01:28:19.040 --> 01:28:20.070
Hurry up!

01:28:20.070 --> 01:28:22.270
You don't have time, do you?

01:28:22.270 --> 01:28:24.510
Then, just one shot...

01:28:24.510 --> 01:28:25.360
All right!

01:28:25.360 --> 01:28:26.210
This time!

01:28:33.800 --> 01:28:35.130
You don't have to be so courteous.

01:28:50.350 --> 01:28:53.070
What is this place?

01:28:53.070 --> 01:28:55.150
It's a museum.

01:28:55.150 --> 01:28:58.680
I've seen dozens of high school students here.

01:29:01.210 --> 01:29:06.440
If Ikari isn't here, we won't be able to leave this town one day.

01:29:06.440 --> 01:29:09.610
But we won't be told anything.

01:29:09.610 --> 01:29:13.930
I can see Ikari suffering in Eva.

01:29:13.930 --> 01:29:17.670
I'll get someone to take care of her!

01:29:17.670 --> 01:29:19.620
I'll take care of her!

01:29:19.620 --> 01:29:25.950
Don't look so suspicious!

01:29:25.950 --> 01:29:27.280
Take care.

01:29:27.280 --> 01:29:28.550
I'll do my best.

01:29:28.550 --> 01:29:29.510
Um...

01:29:31.080 --> 01:29:31.860
It's time.

01:30:00.480 --> 01:30:02.660
I'm the one who has to be beaten up!

01:30:02.660 --> 01:30:10.720
I'm so cowardly!

01:30:10.720 --> 01:30:24.320
I won't let you burn your hands.

01:30:24.320 --> 01:30:27.970
He's gone.

01:30:32.080 --> 01:30:34.250
Is this good enough?

01:30:34.250 --> 01:30:36.360
A dilemma of a mountain storm, huh?

01:30:36.360 --> 01:30:40.170
The more you look at it, the more you hurt your opponent.

01:30:40.170 --> 01:30:43.130
So that's how it is.

01:30:43.130 --> 01:30:51.730
I can only convey my feelings through that way of saying that girl.

01:31:04.120 --> 01:31:11.910
The train will not arrive until 4:20.

01:31:11.910 --> 01:31:15.930
If you don't have a ticket, you are not allowed to use the train.

01:31:15.930 --> 01:31:30.000
Good luck.

01:32:05.630 --> 01:32:08.740
Huh? That's a different person from last time.

01:33:05.790 --> 01:33:11.150
It's dangerous, so please go down to the inside of the yellow line.

01:33:11.150 --> 01:33:15.440
Please be especially careful if you are taking your child with you.

01:33:15.440 --> 01:33:20.250
The next train will depart at 4:32.

01:33:20.250 --> 01:33:23.290
It is a double-deck stop at Gora Station.

01:33:23.290 --> 01:33:27.400
Please get on board and wait for your use.

01:33:30.120 --> 01:33:33.170
Please descend to the inside of the yellow line.

01:33:33.170 --> 01:33:39.310
I'm back.

01:33:39.310 --> 01:33:45.480
Welcome back.

01:34:54.920 --> 01:34:58.460
Rei Ayanami, who lives to the fullest extent of her contact with people.

01:34:58.460 --> 01:35:00.000
She opens her heart.

01:35:00.000 --> 01:35:01.610
It was only Ikari Shirei.

01:35:01.610 --> 01:35:05.020
Shinji is bewildered by a girl who is closer to his father than him.

01:35:05.020 --> 01:35:10.550
Next time, "Rei! Beyond the Heart!"

01:35:10.550 --> 01:35:17.890
This program was brought to you by Kadokawa Shoten and Sega Enterprises.
